 <s>Finite State Machine</s>
 <d>The FSM package provides a simple class that implements a Finite State Machine.

In addition to maintaining state, this FSM also maintains a user-defined payload, therefore effectively making the machine a Pushdown Automaton (a finite state machine with memory).</d>
